WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.832
Talking to patients about vaccines.

2
00:00:03.282 --> 00:00:07.229
Short, evidence-based conversations that address common concerns.

3
00:00:07.679 --> 00:00:12.729
RSV vaccine can be planned alongside other seasonal vaccines in line with local guidance.

4
00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:19.693
RSV causes significant illness in older adults and people with heart or lung disease, but is rarely tested for.

5
00:00:20.143 --> 00:00:26.575
Adult RSV vaccines reduce lower respiratory tract disease in the first seasons after vaccination.
